{"Using `open(url).read` with arbitrary URLs in TopicEmbed is vulnerable to SSRF attacks - needs hardened HTTP client with timeouts, redirect limits, private IP blocking, and protocol restrictions": 0.9814990162849426, "Using `request.referer` as the targetOrigin in `postMessage` creates a security vulnerability - should use whitelisted origin from SiteSetting.embeddable_host instead": 0.9392070174217224, "Setting `X-Frame-Options` to `ALLOWALL` removes clickjacking protection entirely - should use `frame-ancestors` CSP directive to allow only specific embeddable host": 0.8418190479278564, "Returning raw HTML directly without sanitization in Post model creates an XSS vulnerability for content from external sources like RSS imports": 0.9836439490318298, "The default value of `1` for `cook_method` is incorrect - it should be `0` to use `:regular` as the default cook method instead of `:raw_html`, which bypasses the cooking/sanitization pipeline": 0.982680082321167, "Race condition in TopicEmbed.import where `where().first` check followed by creation could allow duplicate topics under concurrent imports of the same URL": 0.9535318613052368, "Using `open(SiteSetting.feed_polling_url)` in PollFeed job lacks SSRF protection - needs hardened HTTP fetching with timeouts, redirect limits, and private network blocking": 0.9901450872421265, "Missing nil/presence checks for `i.content` in PollFeed job will raise NoMethodError if feed item lacks content field": 0.9797416925430298, "The `embed_url` parameter is passed via URL query string without integrity protection - needs HMAC signing or token-based authentication": 0.8444088101387024}